| Secondary text on background | ≥ 4.5:1 | ±0.1 | Sec 2.1.2 |

| Semantic text on background | ≥ 4.5:1 | ±0.1 | Sec 2.1.2 |



\*\*Compliance Rules:\*\*

1. All text/background pairs must achieve ≥ 4.5:1 contrast ratio.

2. If contrast ratio fails, adjust lightness by +5% increments until pass.

3. Color pairs with ratio < 4.5:1 must be flagged and remediated.

4. Verify using WCAG 2.1 relative luminance formula:

&#x20;  - L = 0.2126R + 0.7152G + 0.0722B (sRGB)

